          "launchText": "This week an unknown contact offered you money for access. A colleague, Samira, has seemed to be having a hard week, and at lunch Craig floated a theory that she and Ross, a leaver, are walking off with the client list. Build a short report of what you actually saw, as facts, not a verdict on anyone.",
